  "about": "W3-4: the ONE deck layout. Read by build-deck.ps1 (the profile pages and keys\\keys.map), tools\\deck-render.ps1 (the key pictures), the add-on (exitAt, the opener keys' words) and tests\\deck-layout-test.ps1. Pages are in Stream Deck order LEAVE, MAIN, MORE (a page key moves one step). label: at most 2 lines of 8 characters. role: gold = the one thing he most likely wants now, green = starts something, red = ends something, grey = settings, white = a plain key. action: exe (a key exe; args = its irdeck command in keys.map), screen (an add-on screen's opener key), plugin + what (the CONFIRM key), page (next / previous).",
